# Homepage art direction

Canonical color is Forest, not Aubergine. Read `DESIGN.md` and
`docs/missa-color-direction.md` before generating or placing homepage media.

## Page job

Signed-out `/` is a marketing surface (Spacious density). Primary action:
Browse openings. Headline: **Opportunities and grants for every creator.**

## Four acts

| Act | Surface | Media |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 1 Night library | Exceptional Forest-700 band | Cycling studio plates (`--sref 2605247324`) |
| 2 Open now | True white | Live opportunity artwork only. No generated fakes. |
| 3 The path | True white | Four 4:3 stills (P1–P4) |
| 4 Two doors | True white, full-bleed splits | Two 16:9 plates (A1–A2) |

Do not make the rest of the site dark-first. One Forest hero band, then white.

## Hero H1 (current)

VanMoof density. Full-bleed knit/cyc plate is the hero. Type is a caption,
not a landing-page stack. **Face left. Headline and one Explore control on
the knit, right.** Do not put a headline on the face. No cycling list, no
second overlay, no heavy Forest slab.

- `--sref 2605247324`, forest-black cyc, ochre rim, knit texture
- Headline at section-title scale (24px Newsreader), not marketing display
- Lede names disciplines. Inverse `Button`: white 44px square + label
- Mobile plate: `knit-h1-mobile.jpg` portrait. Desktop: `knit-h1.jpg`
- Mobile nav: compact floating pill (Framer-style), not a sheet
- No green scrim or gradient overlay on the plate

## Motion

Energy lives in the plate, not in UI chrome. Honor reduced-motion. No
infinite Ken Burns.

## Mobbin structure refs (do not copy palettes)

- Interaction: Magnific marketing homepage (list drives the plate)
- Motion energy: VanMoof long-exposure hero
